-*- coding: utf-8 -*-

Packaging notes
===============

pythondialog 3.6.0 is packaged with PEP 517/621 metadata
(pyproject.toml, setuptools build backend). There is no setup.py
anymore.

The ChangeLog file is historical: it was generated from the upstream
Git log up to the 3.5.3 release. New entries are maintained manually in
the same format, or can be generated with gitlog-to-changelog from this
repository's history.

Source distribution
-------------------

Build the sdist with:

  python3 -c "import setuptools.build_meta as b; print(b.build_sdist('dist'))"

or:

  make sdist

The archive is written to dist/ and contains the module, documentation,
examples and tests. It does not contain the .gitignore or CLAUDE.md
files, nor build artifacts.

Gentoo
------

The gentoo/ directory is a complete local overlay. The ebuild
dev-python/pythondialog/pythondialog-3.6.0.ebuild fetches the sdist
attached to the GitHub release v3.6.0. After changing the source,
rebuild the sdist and refresh the Manifest as described in
gentoo/README.md.
